{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41629","headline":"旅次铜山途中先寄温州韩使君 · 陈陶","name":"旅次铜山途中先寄温州韩使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱山沧海曲，中有横阳道。\n束马过铜梁，苕华坐堪老。\n鸠鸣高崖裂，熊鬬深树倒。\n绝壑无坤维，重林失苍昊。\n跻攀寡俦侣，扶接念舆皁。\n俛仰栗嵌空，无因掇灵草。\n梯穷闻戍鼓，魂续赖丘祷。\n敞豁天地归，萦纡村落好。\n悠悠思蒋径，扰扰愧商皓。\n驰想永嘉侯，应伤此怀抱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}